# Dependency Boundaries

Forbidden in `@dndgem/core` imports:

- `packages/dom` and any framework adapter (`react`, `vue`, `angular`, `svelte`)
- browser APIs as dependencies of core logic
- React / Vue / Angular / Svelte runtimes
- dnd-kit
- AI provider SDKs

`@dndgem/dom` may depend on `@dnd-kit/dom` internally. Framework adapters must not.

Adapters may depend on `@dndgem/dom` and, when public Core types require it, `@dndgem/core`. The UI framework is a peerDependency. Adapters must not depend on each other.

Consumers (apps/examples) must import `@dndgem/*` public exports only — never `src/internal` paths or relative package source trees.

Topology source: `scripts/package-topology.mjs`. Run `pnpm check:boundaries` after dependency changes.
